simulate-re-form: `simulate()` now follows the lme4 `re.form` convention.
* `re.form = NA` (the default) or `~0` draws fresh random effects.
* `re.form = NULL` holds the fitted random effects fixed.
i Earlier drmTMB versions gave the explicit values the reverse meaning; check code written for them.
